{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28108","headline":"送徐山人归睦州旧隐 · 雍陶","name":"送徐山人归睦州旧隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君在桐庐何处住，草堂应与戴家邻。\n初归山犬翻惊主，久别江鸥却避人。\n终日欲爲相逐计，临岐空羡独行身。\n秋风钓艇遥相忆，七里滩西片月新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}